<section class="nb-section"><div class="nb-section-head"><span class="nb-kicker">QUESTIONS</span><h2>Questions, answered clearly.</h2><p>A few things to know before you get started.</p></div><div class="nb-faq"><details class="nb-faq-item"><summary>What can I manage through NovBank?</summary><p>Depending on the products enabled for your account, the platform can provide account information, money movement, cards, transaction activity and account security controls.</p></details><details class="nb-faq-item"><summary>How is account security handled?</summary><p>NovBank is being built with layered authentication, session management, transaction controls, auditability and security-focused financial workflows.</p></details><details class="nb-faq-item"><summary>Can NovBank support business banking?</summary><p>The platform architecture is being designed so financial institutions can configure products and operational capabilities for different customer segments.</p></details><details class="nb-faq-item"><summary>Will the platform support additional financial products?</summary><p>The architecture is intentionally modular so additional products and integrations can be introduced without rebuilding the customer experience from scratch.</p></details></div></section>
